	arList=[["玄幻奇幻","xuanhuanqihuan"],["武侠仙侠","wuxiaxianxia"],["都市言情","dushiyanqing"],["历史军事","lishijunshi"],["游戏竞技","youxijingji"],["科幻传奇","kehuanchuanqi"],["恐怖灵异","kongbulingyi"]]
	arList.map(([tag,uri])=>{
		url=`/${uri}/{{page}}.html`;
		push(tag, url, 1, 0.25);
		});
